<body>
<h1 style="color: #1e3a8a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Rencana Implementasi: Role Pimpinan, Standarisasi SLA Waktu Layanan, & Review Kepuasan (SKM)</h1><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">Rencana kerja terpadu ini mencakup 3 pilar utama:</p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">1. <b>Standarisasi Waktu Penyelesaian Layanan (SLA)</b> dengan satuan <b>Hari</b> dan <b>Bulan</b> pada <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan</code> sebagai acuan baku durasi pengerjaan.</p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">2. <b>Pembentukan Role Pimpinan (Role 5: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">pimpinan</code>)</b> khusus Kepala Badan dan Sekretaris BKPSDM Buleleng dengan antarmuka <i>Executive Dashboard</i>.</p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">3. <b>Modul Review Kepuasan Layanan (Survei Kepuasan Masyarakat / SKM)</b> dari Admin OPD saat usulan tiket layanan telah berstatus Selesai.</p><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20px 0;" /><h2 style="color: #1e40af; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">User Review Required</h2><div style="background-color: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #991b1b;"><b style="color: #b91c1c;">PENTING (IMPORTANT):</b></div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;"><b>1. Skema Perubahan Tabel <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan</code></b>:</div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;">* Menambahkan kolom <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu</code> (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">integer</code>, contoh: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">3</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">14</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">1</code>) dan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu</code> (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">enum</code>: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">'hari_kerja'</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">'hari_kalender'</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">'bulan'</code>).</div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;"><i> Kolom lama <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">waktu_penyelesaian</code> tetap dipertahankan dan diisi otomatis sebagai teks representasi (misal: </i>"3 Hari Kerja"<i> atau </i>"1 Bulan"*), sehingga seluruh modul publik dan tabel yang sudah berjalan tidak mengalami kerusakan.</div><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">></p><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;"><b>2. Penambahan Role 5 (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">pimpinan</code>)</b>:</div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;">* Menambahkan record role ID <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">5</code> dengan nama <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">pimpinan</code> pada tabel <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">roles</code>.</div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;">* Hak akses bersifat <b>Read-Only Executive + Export Laporan</b> (tidak memiliki aksi teknis verifikasi/ubah status berkas demi integritas data).</div><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">></p><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;"><b>3. Review Kepuasan Layanan (SKM)</b>:</div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;">* Diberikan saat tiket usulan beralih ke status <b>Selesai</b> (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">archives = 1</code>).</div><div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 8px 12px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #475569;">* Skala 1–5 Bintang (PermenPAN-RB No. 14 Tahun 2017) + Quick Chips Aspek Layanan + Catatan/Saran.</div><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20px 0;" /><h2 style="color: #1e40af; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Rincian Perubahan Tabel Database</h2><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">A. Modifikasi Tabel <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan</code> (Standarisasi Waktu Penyelesaian)</h3><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">Melalui migrasi baru <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">add_sla_columns_to_tb_layanan_table</code>:</p><div style="background-color: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 10px 14px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10pt; color: #0f172a; margin: 10px 0;">ALTER TABLE tb_layanan <br />
    ADD COLUMN target_waktu INT NULL AFTER rangkap,<br />
    ADD COLUMN satuan_waktu ENUM(&#039;hari_kerja&#039;, &#039;hari_kalender&#039;, &#039;bulan&#039;) DEFAULT &#039;hari_kerja&#039; AFTER target_waktu;<br />
</div><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;"><b>Contoh Data</b>:</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Layanan Cuti Tahunan: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu = 3</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu = 'hari_kerja'</code> ➔ <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">waktu_penyelesaian = "3 Hari Kerja"</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Layanan Kenaikan Pangkat: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu = 1</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu = 'bulan'</code> ➔ <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">waktu_penyelesaian = "1 Bulan"</code>.</li></ul><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">B. Pembuatan Tabel Baru <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan_review</code> (Survei Kepuasan)</h3><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">Melalui migrasi baru <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">create_layanan_reviews_table</code>:</p><div style="background-color: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 10px 14px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10pt; color: #0f172a; margin: 10px 0;">CREATE TABLE tb_layanan_review (<br />
    id BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,<br />
    no_tiket VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE,<br />
    kode_layanan VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL,<br />
    kode_bidang BIGINT NOT NULL,<br />
    kode_ukerja VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,<br />
    user_id BIGINT NOT NULL,<br />
    rating TINYINT NOT NULL, -- Skala 1 sampai 5<br />
    aspek_penilaian JSON NULL, -- Contoh: [&quot;Kecepatan&quot;, &quot;Kejelasan SOP&quot;, &quot;Keramahan&quot;]<br />
    komentar TEXT NULL,<br />
    created_at TIMESTAMP NULL,<br />
    updated_at TIMESTAMP NULL,<br />
    FOREIGN KEY (no_tiket) REFERENCES tb_regtiket(no_tiket) ON DELETE CASCADE,<br />
    FOREIGN KEY (kode_layanan) REFERENCES tb_layanan(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,<br />
    FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE<br />
);<br />
</div><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">C. Seeder Role Pimpinan (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">roles</code>)</h3><div style="background-color: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 10px 14px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10pt; color: #0f172a; margin: 10px 0;">Role::firstOrCreate([&#039;id&#039; =&gt; 5], [&#039;name&#039; =&gt; &#039;pimpinan&#039;]);<br />
</div><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20px 0;" /><h2 style="color: #1e40af; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Mekanisme Perhitungan Batas Waktu (SLA Calculator)</h2><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">Dengan adanya kolom <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu</code> dan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu</code>, sistem menghitung batas waktu pengerjaan secara otomatis:</p><div style="background-color: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 10px 14px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10pt; color: #0f172a; margin: 10px 0;">// Helper kalkulasi batas deadline di App\Services\SlaService atau Model Regtiket<br />
public function hitungDeadlineSla($tanggalUsulan, $targetWaktu, $satuanWaktu)<br />
{<br />
    $start = Carbon::parse($tanggalUsulan);<br />
<br />
    if ($satuanWaktu === &#039;bulan&#039;) {<br />
        // Jika BULAN: Cukup tambahkan bulan kalender<br />
        return $start-&gt;copy()-&gt;addMonths($targetWaktu);<br />
    }<br />
<br />
    if ($satuanWaktu === &#039;hari_kalender&#039;) {<br />
        return $start-&gt;copy()-&gt;addDays($targetWaktu);<br />
    }<br />
<br />
    // Default &#039;hari_kerja&#039;: Mengecualikan hari Sabtu dan Minggu<br />
    $deadline = $start-&gt;copy();<br />
    $addedDays = 0;<br />
    while ($addedDays &lt; $targetWaktu) {<br />
        $deadline-&gt;addDay();<br />
        if (!$deadline-&gt;isWeekend()) {<br />
            $addedDays++;<br />
        }<br />
    }<br />
    return $deadline;<br />
}<br />
</div><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20px 0;" /><h2 style="color: #1e40af; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Proposed Changes</h2><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">1. Backend (Database, Models, Controllers, Routes)</h3><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [add_sla_columns_to_tb_layanan_table.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Migrasi penambahan kolom <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu</code> dan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu</code> pada <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan</code>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [create_layanan_reviews_table.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Migrasi pembuatan tabel <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan_review</code>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [RoleSeeder.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Menambahkan record role 5: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Role::firstOrCreate(['id' => 5], ['name' => 'pimpinan']);</code>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [Layanan.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Menambahkan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu</code> dan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu</code> ke <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">$fillable</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Menambahkan relasi <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">hasMany(LayananReview::class, 'kode_layanan', 'id')</code>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [LayananReview.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Model Eloquent untuk data ulasan SKM dengan relasi ke <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Regtiket</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Layanan</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">User</code>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [Regtiket.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Menambahkan relasi <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">hasOne(LayananReview::class, 'no_tiket', 'no_tiket')</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Menyesuaikan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">scopeVisibleBy</code> agar role <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">pimpinan</code> (role ID 5) memiliki hak akses baca seluruh usulan secara global (<i>global visibility</i>).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Menambahkan Accessor <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">getSlaStatusAttribute()</code> untuk mendeteksi apakah tiket berstatus <i>Tepat Waktu</i>, <i>Mendekati Batas</i>, atau <i>Terlambat</i>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [LayananController.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Memperbarui method <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">store</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">update</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">storeBidang</code>, <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">updateBidang</code> agar menerima <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">target_waktu</code> dan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">satuan_waktu</code> serta mengenerate otomatis string <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">waktu_penyelesaian</code>.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [LayananReviewController.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Method <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">store(Request $request)</code>: Menerima submission bintang dan testimoni dari Admin OPD untuk tiket selesai.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [PimpinanController.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Method <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">dashboard()</code>: Mengagregasi metrik pimpinan:</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Total Usulan Masuk & Tingkat Penyelesaian (%).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Indeks Rata-rata Kepuasan OPD (IKM Skor 1-5).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Persentase Kepatuhan SLA Waktu (Tepat Waktu vs Terlambat).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Grafik perbandingan beban kerja dan kecepatan 4 Bidang BKPSDM.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Method <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">evaluasiKepuasan()</code>: Analisis detail hasil SKM per bidang dan testimoni OPD.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Method <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">exportPdf()</code>: Cetak ringkasan eksekutif satu halaman untuk Kepala Badan.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [menu.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Mendaftarkan menu role 5 (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">pimpinan</code>):</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;"><b>Dashboard Eksekutif</b>: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">/pimpinan/dashboard</code></li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;"><b>Evaluasi Kepuasan (SKM)</b>: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">/pimpinan/kepuasan</code></li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;"><b>Kinerja & Kecepatan Bidang</b>: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">/pimpinan/kinerja-bidang</code></li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;"><b>Rekap Seluruh Usulan</b>: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">/pimpinan/usulan</code></li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;"><b>Laporan Eksekutif</b>: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">/pimpinan/laporan</code></li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [web.php</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Rute grup <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">middleware(['auth', 'role:pimpinan'])</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Rute POST <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">/tiket/{no_tiket}/review</code> untuk submit ulasan.</li></ul><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20px 0;" /><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">2. Frontend (Inertia React UI Sesuai Standard.md)</h3><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">MODIFY] [Root/Layanan/Create.jsx & Edit.jsx</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Mengganti input tunggal <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">waktu_penyelesaian</code> menjadi kombinasi:</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Input Angka: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Jumlah Waktu (Contoh: 3, 14, 1)</code></li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Dropdown Combobox: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Satuan Waktu (Hari Kerja, Hari Kalender, Bulan)</code></li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Preview teks otomatis di bawahnya.</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [ReviewModal.jsx</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Pop-up rating bintang interaktif (1–5) dengan micro-animations, quick-chips aspek pelayanan (<i>Kecepatan, Keramahan, Kejelasan SOP</i>), dan textarea masukan.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Diintegrasikan pada halaman Arsip OPD (<code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Opd/Tiket/Index.jsx</code> atau <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">Opd/Archives/Index.jsx</code>).</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [Pimpinan/Dashboard/Index.jsx</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Dashboard eksekutif modern:</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">4 Kartu Metrik Utama (Total Usulan, % Kepatuhan SLA Waktu, Rata-rata Skor IKM, Rasio BTL).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Grafik tren usulan & kepatuhan waktu per bidang BKPSDM.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Tabel peringkat OPD (Paling Tertib Administrasi vs Paling Banyak BTL).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Tombol Quick Action: "Cetak Ringkasan Eksekutif (PDF)".</li></ul><h4 style="color: #2563eb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><span style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">NEW] [Pimpinan/Kepuasan/Index.jsx</span></h4><ul style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 24px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Halaman survei kepuasan masyarakat:</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Rata-rata bintang per bidang (⭐ 4.8 / 5.0).</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Grafik distribusi bintang 1 sampai 5.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;">Daftar masukan/saran terbuka dari masing-masing OPD se-Kabupaten Buleleng.</li></ul><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20px 0;" /><h2 style="color: #1e40af; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Verification Plan</h2><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">Automated Tests</h3><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">1. Migrasi database: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">php artisan migrate</code></p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">2. Pengecekan route: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">php artisan route:list --name=pimpinan</code></p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">3. Kompilasi frontend: <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">npm run build</code></p><h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;">Manual Verification</h3><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">1. <b>Master Layanan</b>: Input layanan dengan format <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">3 Hari Kerja</code> dan <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">1 Bulan</code>. Pastikan tersimpan rapi di database.</p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">2. <b>Alur SKM OPD</b>: Buka tiket usulan yang telah selesai di akun Admin OPD, isi review bintang 5 dan saran. Pastikan tersimpan di <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">tb_layanan_review</code>.</p><p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify;">3. <b>Dashboard Pimpinan</b>: Login dengan user role <code style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #be185d; border-radius: 4px;">pimpinan</code>. Verifikasi bahwa grafik kepatuhan SLA waktu (hari vs bulan) dan rata-rata rating kepuasan muncul secara akurat.</p>
<div style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px dashed #94a3b8; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 9pt; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center;">
Dokumen Teknis Pengembangan PILKB BKPSDM Kabupaten Buleleng • 15 September 2026
</div>
</body>
</html>